A. character of the sum-zero (tetrahedron) representation of S4
   e          size  1  trace {np.float64(3.0)}  det {np.float64(1.0)}
   (ij)       size  6  trace {np.float64(1.0)}  det {np.float64(-1.0)}
   (ijk)      size  8  trace {np.float64(-0.0)}  det {np.float64(1.0)}
   (ij)(kl)   size  3  trace {np.float64(-1.0)}  det {np.float64(1.0)}
   (ijkl)     size  6  trace {np.float64(-1.0)}  det {np.float64(-1.0)}
   => (3,1,0,-1,-1) is the partition [3,1] (standard rep V), NOT [2,1,1] (= V (x) sgn)

