D. uniqueness of the S3 intertwiner / S4 extension
   alpha=0.0: same S3 images True; U4_NV changes by 0.000
   alpha=0.7: same S3 images True; U4_NV changes by 0.457
   alpha=2.0: same S3 images True; U4_NV changes by 1.122
   => the S3 data fix V only up to a relative phase between |0> and the E block; the 4-cycle's NV matrix is NOT unique (a one-parameter family).

